1
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,310
What happened here?

2
00:01:08,384 --> 00:01:10,144
Daozhou has been hit by severe flooding.

3
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:12,280
We all fled here to escape the disaster.

4
00:01:18,510 --> 00:01:18,950
Here.

5
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,150
It's so hot.

6
00:01:28,752 --> 00:01:30,920
Use our carriage to take her
to the medical clinic.

7
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:31,510
All right.

8
00:01:33,510 --> 00:01:33,950
Here.

9
00:01:34,150 --> 00:01:35,120
Thank you, Young Lady.

10
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:36,790
Thank you.

11
00:01:44,784 --> 00:01:46,310
I'll have the local magistrate's office

12
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:47,824
arrange shelter for these refugees.

13
00:03:11,216 --> 00:03:12,110
=Blossoms of Power=

14
00:03:12,112 --> 00:03:15,060
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

15
00:03:15,140 --> 00:03:18,100
=Episode 29=

16
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:19,080
Here.

17
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:21,190
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

18
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,280
- One for me, Lady.
- Here.

19
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:28,560
Thank you.

20
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,280
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

21
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:31,630
Thank you.

22
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:32,310
Here you go.

23
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:33,280
Thank you.

24
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,280
Here.

25
00:03:44,190 --> 00:03:44,800
Thank you.

26
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,360
Drink slowly.

27
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,590
Thank you, Sister.

28
00:03:48,470 --> 00:03:49,590
Go bring two more bowls.

29
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:50,120
Yes.

30
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,190
You've worked hard.

31
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:00,430
I just looked around.

32
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:03,960
Food, shelter, and supplies to keep out
the damp and cold are all well prepared.

33
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:07,360
You have made excellent arrangements.

34
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,120
It is my duty.

35
00:04:09,750 --> 00:04:10,960
Thank you for your praise.

36
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,400
I have a few suggestions.

37
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,048
I'm not sure if they're appropriate.

38
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,750
Please.

39
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,830
We should have more ginger tea prepared

40
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,160
to help prevent colds.

41
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,870
Also, colds are contagious.

42
00:04:20,944 --> 00:04:22,752
If those who are sick
aren't isolated in time,

43
00:04:22,816 --> 00:04:24,240
they could spread it to others.

44
00:04:24,390 --> 00:04:26,120
The refugees
should be housed separately.

45
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,680
That would be more appropriate.

46
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,310
You are absolutely right.

47
00:04:29,870 --> 00:04:30,720
On this matter,

48
00:04:31,070 --> 00:04:32,630
I was indeed negligent.

49
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:35,240
Thank you for the reminder.

50
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:39,390
Physicians and medicine
are both in short supply in town.

51
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,510
Mo Yu is my personal physician.

52
00:04:41,830 --> 00:04:44,040
I'll leave her here for you
to call on at any time.

53
00:04:44,656 --> 00:04:46,160
As for the medicine in the carriage,

54
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,720
have her bring all of it over as well.

55
00:04:48,390 --> 00:04:49,480
On behalf of the people,

56
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,680
thank you.

57
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,360
You're back.

58
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:21,630
I'm back.

59
00:05:29,104 --> 00:05:30,600
Changqing, you've worked hard today.

60
00:05:31,184 --> 00:05:32,830
You still have
many matters to attend to.

61
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,600
In that case,

62
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,240
I'll take my leave.

63
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:41,190
If Your Highnesses need anything,

64
00:05:41,190 --> 00:05:42,528
just send someone to let me know.

65
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,510
By the way,

66
00:05:44,896 --> 00:05:47,630
I heard you gave up your horse
to take a refugee to the medical clinic

67
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:48,870
and walked here yourself.

68
00:05:49,152 --> 00:05:50,900
These medicines
will help keep out the cold.

69
00:05:50,944 --> 00:05:52,032
You should find them useful.

70
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,000
Thank you, Changqing.

71
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,240
I'll take my leave.

72
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,480
Here, warm yourself up.

73
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,360
I'll do it myself.

74
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:12,920
Is it too hot?

75
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,720
You've worked hard today.

76
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,240
What I could do

77
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,920
was only to address
the immediate crisis.

78
00:07:38,944 --> 00:07:41,584
The people who managed to escape
are already suffering like this.

79
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,720
Those still trapped in Wudeng County

80
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,480
must be in even worse shape.

81
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:49,456
Right now, they lack everything
from food and clothing to shelter.

82
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,510
Medicine is the highest priority.

83
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,240
Whatever they need,

84
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,390
we'll send it.

85
00:07:58,390 --> 00:07:59,070
Send it?

86
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,310
The roads leading to Wudeng County

87
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:03,680
have almost all been destroyed.

88
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,430
Even if we gather
enough relief supplies,

89
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:08,830
getting them safely
into the people's hands

90
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,160
would be nearly impossible.

91
00:08:12,310 --> 00:08:13,630
Then we'll deliver them by air.

92
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:15,830
What do you mean?

93
00:08:39,952 --> 00:08:42,320
(Daozhou Granary Records)
This is the inventory record of

94
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:44,016
all the grain and supplies in Daozhou.

95
00:08:44,064 --> 00:08:45,264
(Daozhou Granary Records: Medicine)

96
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,750
At this rate, in less than five days,

97
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,800
Daozhou will run out
of both food and medicine.

98
00:08:55,030 --> 00:08:56,600
So what exactly is your plan?

99
00:08:56,704 --> 00:08:57,840
Stop keeping me in suspense.

100
00:08:58,870 --> 00:08:59,720
Look at this map.

101
00:09:01,728 --> 00:09:04,550
(Daozhou Zhaoshui Wharf)
Supplies will be loaded onto ships

102
00:09:04,624 --> 00:09:06,416
at the wharf,
then transported into Daozhou,

103
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:08,130
before being redirected
onto this waterway.

104
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:10,200
This waterway
wasn't affected by the flooding.

105
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:11,510
The current is gentle,

106
00:09:11,510 --> 00:09:12,700
making it suitable for docking.

107
00:09:12,752 --> 00:09:14,336
It's also the closest route to Daozhou.

108
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:18,080
Then I'll have people drive several
wooden posts into both riverbanks,

109
00:09:18,112 --> 00:09:19,392
and connect them with iron cables.

110
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:21,320
The supplies will
be tightly wrapped in oilcloth

111
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,120
and sent across by cable.

112
00:09:23,232 --> 00:09:25,696
From there, they'll
be transported to Wudeng County.

113
00:09:26,390 --> 00:09:27,440
That way,

114
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,440
it'll be much faster.

115
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:30,440
If we build several more cableways,

116
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:32,080
even large amounts of grain and cloth

117
00:09:32,390 --> 00:09:33,840
can be delivered within a day or two.

118
00:09:34,390 --> 00:09:34,960
Exactly.

119
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,030
How did you come up with

120
00:09:37,030 --> 00:09:38,030
such a brilliant idea?

121
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,440
You flatter me.

122
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,910
When I traveled the country years ago,

123
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,240
I saw mountain villagers

124
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,000
using this very method
to transport grain.

125
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,630
If the cableway is sturdy enough,

126
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:51,910
it can even carry people.

127
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:56,200
I merely adapted what I saw.

128
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,264
When all is said and done,

129
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,150
the people are the wisest of all.

130
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,200
Seeing the Crown Prince,

131
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,480
so full of the warmth of everyday life,

132
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,720
puts everyone even more at ease.

133
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:21,000
Why are your hands so cold?

134
00:10:26,624 --> 00:10:28,910
You know I've always
been sensitive to the cold.

135
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:30,480
It's nothing serious.

136
00:10:34,870 --> 00:10:35,630
Your Highness,

137
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:37,550
I dared to come
to the imperial capital alone

138
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,670
and step into the Imperial Palace.

139
00:10:39,728 --> 00:10:41,792
That means I have
the confidence to keep going.

140
00:10:41,872 --> 00:10:43,344
You don't need to worry about me.

141
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:46,390
Just focus on getting yourself well.

142
00:10:50,550 --> 00:10:52,240
Of course I know that
better than anyone.

143
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:56,080
I only

144
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,510
want to treat you even better.

145
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,790
Since the day we met,

146
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,550
I've benefited from you in so many ways,

147
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,360
yet I've never...

148
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,200
Between you and me,

149
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:14,064
there's never any need to say thank you.

150
00:11:17,550 --> 00:11:19,480
I want to thank you
for coming into my life

151
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:21,870
like a gift from heaven.

152
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,510
Thank you for loving me so deeply,

153
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,600
for being honest with me
and giving me your whole heart.

154
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:32,080
To have become your wife,

155
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,480
I have no regrets.

156
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,600
I establish a nation

157
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,270
for the well-being of its people,

158
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:11,960
and put ending tyranny first.

159
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:15,870
The Crown Prince Xiao Huayong
and Crown Princess Shen,

160
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:18,910
who stood fast in a city under siege
and steadied the army's morale,

161
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:21,000
have rendered
great service in turning the tide.

162
00:12:21,010 --> 00:12:22,570
Therefore, we bestow upon Crown Prince

163
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:24,710
and Crown Princess
one pair of Dongzhu pearls each,

164
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,270
and a pair of jade ruyi,

165
00:12:26,270 --> 00:12:28,120
in recognition
of their meritorious service.

166
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,720
Prince Xin Xiao Changqing

167
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:34,510
killed the rebel general on the
battlefield, boosting the army's morale.

168
00:12:34,870 --> 00:12:39,080
Therefore, I bestow upon Prince Xin
50 kg of gold and 100 bolts of brocade.

169
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,480
Prince Ding Xiao Changtai.

170
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:44,320
For inciting rebellion,
his crime is unforgivable.

171
00:12:44,368 --> 00:12:46,480
All prefectures
and counties along the route

172
00:12:46,496 --> 00:12:48,480
are ordered to search
for and apprehend him.

173
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:52,000
Once captured, he shall be escorted back
to the imperial capital immediately.

174
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:54,510
No member of the Imperial Clan
shall show favoritism.

175
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:56,510
Let this decree be carried out.

176
00:12:56,510 --> 00:12:59,580
(East Palace)

177
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:45,320
Why can't you sleep?

178
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,150
I've been thinking

179
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:56,440
about seeing Father

180
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,840
and Grandmother today.

181
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:03,200
Grandmother said

182
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,960
that the two of us, as husband and wife,

183
00:14:06,352 --> 00:14:08,270
must safeguard the peace
of the realm together.

184
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,720
Do you think

185
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,992
the burden on your shoulders
has grown heavier?

186
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,270
That's not it.

187
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,790
Then what is it?

188
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,200
Grandmother said...

189
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,630
she wants to have a great-grandchild.

190
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:11,910
You really can't sleep?

191
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:17,630
Earlier today,

192
00:15:18,550 --> 00:15:19,600
we played a game of chess,

193
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:21,200
but it ended without a winner.

194
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:23,440
Why don't we finish it now?

195
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,320
I don't feel like playing chess.

196
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:34,150
At the hunting grounds last month,

197
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,670
during the polo match,

198
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:38,670
didn't you say it ended too soon?

199
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,870
Then let's get up and chat.

200
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:44,112
I don't feel like talking about polo.

201
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,200
How about this?

202
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:54,390
I'll prepare
a calming incense blend for you.

203
00:15:55,550 --> 00:15:57,720
Would you like to try it?

204
00:16:08,790 --> 00:16:09,960
I don't feel like trying it.

205
00:16:34,070 --> 00:16:37,140
♪Time passes like a dream♪

206
00:16:38,210 --> 00:16:40,820
♪Pushing the sea
of stars to flow across♪

207
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:44,840
♪Flowers wilt and bloom again♪

208
00:16:45,790 --> 00:16:47,000
Stop it.

209
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:50,960
I thought

210
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:54,150
I'd already made myself clear.

211
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,840
♪Gently spreading through the blossoms♪

212
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:59,510
♪How sweet this yearning is♪

213
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:04,190
♪Yet who among us still roams
like we did when we were young?♪

214
00:17:06,150 --> 00:17:08,820
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

215
00:17:10,180 --> 00:17:12,890
♪Alone for several autumns♪

216
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:16,730
♪How to choose the one♪

217
00:17:17,110 --> 00:17:20,670
♪To be with forever?♪

218
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:25,040
♪When I gaze upon you♪

219
00:17:25,670 --> 00:17:28,560
♪Flower petals twirl gently in my heart♪

220
00:17:28,590 --> 00:17:29,720
Actually,

221
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:31,280
I think the Crown Prince is quite good.

222
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:33,200
Of course you do.

223
00:17:34,460 --> 00:17:36,260
(Clarity and Serenity)

224
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,160
See? I told you they weren't asleep yet.

225
00:17:40,510 --> 00:17:44,120
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

226
00:17:45,290 --> 00:17:47,060
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

227
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:48,080
See? I told you.

228
00:17:48,100 --> 00:17:50,440
The Crown Prince may look every bit
the perfect gentleman,

229
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:52,480
but he's really a shameless flirt.

230
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,750
You can't say that.

231
00:17:57,110 --> 00:17:57,830
Let's go.

232
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:03,180
(Clarity and Serenity)

233
00:18:04,490 --> 00:18:08,000
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

234
00:18:25,650 --> 00:18:32,510
♪And a pool of me♪

235
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,110
Your Highness.

236
00:18:35,590 --> 00:18:37,400
You have court tomorrow.

237
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,240
I know.

238
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,200
Then behave yourself.

239
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,550
How can I behave

240
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,750
with you beside me?

241
00:19:11,216 --> 00:19:12,920
You have been awake for quite some time.

242
00:19:13,072 --> 00:19:14,736
Why haven't you gotten dressed yet?

243
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:25,400
Getting dressed

244
00:19:25,790 --> 00:19:27,550
has always been Tian Yuan's duty.

245
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:31,830
Now,

246
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:33,590
I have a wife.

247
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,310
Would you still leave

248
00:19:35,472 --> 00:19:37,160
something this personal to someone else?

249
00:19:39,070 --> 00:19:40,310
What if I say no?

250
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:43,440
We agreed to treat
each other with mutual respect.

251
00:19:43,616 --> 00:19:45,648
My arms are getting tired
from holding them up.

252
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:21,790
Turn around.

253
00:22:03,030 --> 00:22:04,070
What are you doing?

254
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:06,720
Since we're to treat
each other with mutual respect,

255
00:22:07,110 --> 00:22:08,400
then let me

256
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:09,920
do something for you as well.

257
00:22:25,720 --> 00:22:26,550
I'll do it myself.

258
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:28,310
You don't need to do my makeup...

259
00:22:29,350 --> 00:22:30,110
Hold still.

260
00:22:30,944 --> 00:22:32,544
Be careful, or it'll come out crooked.

261
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:35,650
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

262
00:22:36,970 --> 00:22:42,250
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

263
00:22:44,180 --> 00:22:47,120
♪I've hidden so many words♪

264
00:22:47,740 --> 00:22:50,540
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

265
00:22:51,410 --> 00:22:58,380
♪So never uncover♪

266
00:22:58,570 --> 00:23:00,930
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

267
00:23:02,060 --> 00:23:04,790
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

268
00:23:05,750 --> 00:23:11,090
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

269
00:23:12,850 --> 00:23:15,670
♪Every answer I gave♪

270
00:23:16,470 --> 00:23:19,320
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

271
00:23:20,110 --> 00:23:23,480
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

272
00:23:23,740 --> 00:23:27,050
♪How hard it truly was?♪

273
00:23:30,020 --> 00:23:33,460
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

274
00:23:34,450 --> 00:23:36,780
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

275
00:23:38,050 --> 00:23:41,050
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

276
00:23:41,070 --> 00:23:42,640
Every look you wear

277
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:45,680
leaves everyone in awe.

278
00:23:46,110 --> 00:23:47,680
The noble ladies

279
00:23:48,270 --> 00:23:49,480
all rush to imitate her.

280
00:23:50,750 --> 00:23:51,550
Today,

281
00:23:52,080 --> 00:23:54,576
it's sure to become
the latest fashion throughout the city.

282
00:23:58,560 --> 00:24:02,230
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

283
00:24:03,100 --> 00:24:05,860
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

284
00:24:06,300 --> 00:24:09,430
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

285
00:24:09,870 --> 00:24:16,240
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

286
00:24:17,410 --> 00:24:23,120
♪The flustered mortal world♪

287
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:27,310
Done.

288
00:24:48,580 --> 00:24:51,940
(Cultivate Virtue
and Practice Righteousness)

289
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:53,830
This is the list of palace maids to
be released under the general amnesty.

290
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:56,270
Palace Domestic Service and Court of
Imperial Clan Affairs have verified it.

291
00:24:56,350 --> 00:24:57,600
No one has been overlooked.

292
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:04,240
Go with the palace attendants from

293
00:25:04,304 --> 00:25:05,750
the Palace Domestic Service yourself.

294
00:25:05,760 --> 00:25:07,920
Make sure every palace maid
leaves the palace safely.

295
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:08,750
Go on.

296
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:09,440
Yes.

297
00:25:15,070 --> 00:25:15,920
Your Highness.

298
00:25:16,032 --> 00:25:17,550
His Majesty has just issued a decree.

299
00:25:17,550 --> 00:25:19,270
Prince Xin has been rewarded
for suppressing the rebellion.

300
00:25:19,270 --> 00:25:21,490
Noble Consort Rong has been
restored to her former rank.

301
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:24,240
Come.

302
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:26,590
Let's go congratulate
Noble Consort Rong.

303
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,830
Greetings, Noble Consort Rong.

304
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:50,224
Thank you for coming.

305
00:25:50,336 --> 00:25:52,540
After His Majesty granted amnesty
to the inner palace,

306
00:25:52,550 --> 00:25:55,110
the palace maids of Hanzhang Hall
were also included on the list.

307
00:25:55,120 --> 00:25:57,400
So I have prepared
some newly assigned palace maids

308
00:25:57,550 --> 00:25:58,550
for you.

309
00:25:58,960 --> 00:25:59,920
Starting today,

310
00:26:00,350 --> 00:26:02,440
you will all serve at Hanzhang Hall.

311
00:26:03,030 --> 00:26:03,830
- Yes.
- Yes.

312
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,160
Their assignments

313
00:26:07,296 --> 00:26:08,680
will be entirely at your discretion.

314
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:10,480
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

315
00:26:15,660 --> 00:26:18,380
(Sixian Hall)

316
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:24,310
Your Highness.

317
00:26:25,616 --> 00:26:26,680
Is the Crown Princess here?

318
00:26:26,960 --> 00:26:28,000
She's in the side hall.

319
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,400
Her Highness is blending incense.

320
00:26:30,448 --> 00:26:31,500
Please wait a moment.

321
00:26:31,510 --> 00:26:32,680
I'll inform her right away.

322
00:26:33,350 --> 00:26:34,000
No need.

323
00:26:34,790 --> 00:26:36,000
I'll wait for her here.

324
00:26:36,112 --> 00:26:37,216
Go on with your work.

325
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:38,310
Yes.

326
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:01,550
Your Highness?

327
00:27:05,270 --> 00:27:06,480
When did you get here?

328
00:27:06,576 --> 00:27:07,680
Just a little while ago.

329
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,110
Why didn't you come in?

330
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,410
Mo Yu told me

331
00:27:10,420 --> 00:27:12,580
you don't like being disturbed
while blending incense,

332
00:27:12,590 --> 00:27:13,680
so I waited outside.

333
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:14,550
Mo Yu?

334
00:27:15,936 --> 00:27:18,240
I sent her to lay out
the incense ingredients to dry.

335
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:20,110
That was two hours ago.

336
00:27:20,592 --> 00:27:22,070
You've been waiting that long?

337
00:27:22,720 --> 00:27:24,030
This is the East Palace.

338
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:26,590
There's nowhere you can't go.

339
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:28,590
I didn't want to break your rules.

340
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:30,480
Between husband and wife,

341
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:32,110
respect matters even more.

342
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,550
I used to think

343
00:27:36,880 --> 00:27:39,480
marriage meant making compromises.

344
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:41,400
But now I think

345
00:27:41,830 --> 00:27:43,550
we're even more at ease

346
00:27:43,550 --> 00:27:44,864
than we were before we married.

347
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:46,590
Come.

348
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:03,960
What are you looking at?

349
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:04,880
That's quite a stack.

350
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:09,328
Princess Anling's wedding to the newly
crowned top scholar is fast approaching.

351
00:29:09,750 --> 00:29:11,790
Everything from the betrothal gifts

352
00:29:11,800 --> 00:29:13,350
to the dowry and ceremonial procession

353
00:29:13,350 --> 00:29:14,510
must be reviewed carefully.

354
00:29:14,590 --> 00:29:15,510
Besides,

355
00:29:15,830 --> 00:29:17,880
several palace halls

356
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:19,420
were recently found to be in disrepair.

357
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:20,790
These plans and cost estimates

358
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:22,352
must also be reviewed one by one.

359
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:38,640
Look at you.

360
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,640
Your eyes are bloodshot
from overworking.

361
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,400
The affairs of the Six Palaces

362
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:48,590
will never be finished.

363
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,070
Take a break first.

364
00:29:50,310 --> 00:29:51,750
I hate seeing you work so hard.

365
00:29:54,830 --> 00:29:57,720
If you hate seeing me work so hard,

366
00:29:58,030 --> 00:29:59,200
then perhaps

367
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:02,480
you could help me with some of it.

368
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:09,400
Helping my beloved wife

369
00:30:09,550 --> 00:30:10,510
is only right.

370
00:30:26,270 --> 00:30:27,960
Take care of your work.

371
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:30,240
As you command.

372
00:30:39,270 --> 00:30:39,750
By the way,

373
00:30:40,624 --> 00:30:43,110
Father knows how exhausting
the trip to the northwest was,

374
00:30:43,120 --> 00:30:45,440
so he has invited the Imperial Clan
to the hunting grounds

375
00:30:45,472 --> 00:30:46,640
to relax for a few days.

376
00:30:47,750 --> 00:30:49,680
Changqing will accompany us,

377
00:30:49,760 --> 00:30:51,840
and Changying
will be responsible for security.

378
00:30:52,704 --> 00:30:54,432
Many thanks for His Majesty's grace.

379
00:31:54,110 --> 00:31:55,070
Your Highness,

380
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:57,024
what is the meaning of this?

381
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,400
Changqing.

382
00:31:58,528 --> 00:31:59,680
This deer is still young.

383
00:31:59,830 --> 00:32:00,550
Let it go.

384
00:32:58,288 --> 00:32:59,480
Watch out, Changqing!

385
00:33:23,550 --> 00:33:25,750
Isn't this the one
the Crown Prince took?

386
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:27,550
You haven't even finished the edging.

387
00:33:31,830 --> 00:33:32,590
Your Highness.

388
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,160
The Crown Prince is missing.

389
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:35,680
What?

390
00:33:35,744 --> 00:33:37,790
His Highness and the other princes
were ambushed

391
00:33:37,790 --> 00:33:38,950
while hunting in the mountains.

392
00:33:38,960 --> 00:33:41,310
The Crown Prince and Prince Xin
have both gone missing.

393
00:33:41,550 --> 00:33:43,480
Who would dare abduct a prince

394
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:44,768
under His Majesty's very nose?

395
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:45,488
Your Highness,

396
00:33:45,490 --> 00:33:47,300
could it be the one
who poisoned His Highness?

397
00:33:47,310 --> 00:33:47,880
No.

398
00:33:48,512 --> 00:33:50,110
That person has always acted in secret.

399
00:33:50,352 --> 00:33:52,000
They wouldn't make such a big commotion.

400
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:52,920
In my opinion,

401
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:54,400
whoever abducted the Crown Prince

402
00:33:54,400 --> 00:33:55,440
has another purpose.

403
00:33:55,440 --> 00:33:56,920
Until that purpose is revealed,

404
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:58,780
His Highness's life
should not be in danger.

405
00:33:58,790 --> 00:34:00,790
Should we send Crown Prince's
guards to search?

406
00:34:00,790 --> 00:34:02,000
And my guards as well.

407
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:04,350
Under my orders.

408
00:34:05,456 --> 00:34:07,550
The people I have hidden
in the Imperial Capital

409
00:34:07,560 --> 00:34:09,360
were all placed there
by the Duke and the Heir

410
00:34:09,376 --> 00:34:11,280
for your protection
in case of emergencies.

411
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:12,630
If we send them all out,

412
00:34:12,656 --> 00:34:13,920
their identities will be exposed.

413
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:15,840
Every moment we lose

414
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:17,392
puts His Highness in greater danger.

415
00:34:17,710 --> 00:34:19,550
I can't risk the Crown Prince's life.

416
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,030
I'm going with you.

417
00:34:50,480 --> 00:34:51,880
The place is heavily guarded.

418
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:54,360
Breaking out

419
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:56,030
will be nearly impossible.

420
00:35:04,510 --> 00:35:05,070
Stop.

421
00:35:07,360 --> 00:35:08,630
Why did you

422
00:35:09,030 --> 00:35:10,110
abduct us?

423
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:23,880
Whatever their purpose is,

424
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:26,150
they've brought us food and water.

425
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:28,440
At least they won't kill us for now.

426
00:35:28,760 --> 00:35:29,800
The one behind all this

427
00:35:29,888 --> 00:35:31,712
will reveal themselves sooner or later.

428
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:42,880
Changqing.

429
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:45,960
Changqing.

430
00:35:49,280 --> 00:35:50,150
Changqing!

431
00:35:51,670 --> 00:35:52,480
What is it?

432
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:54,960
I'm hurt.

433
00:35:55,230 --> 00:35:56,840
Could you bandage it for me?

434
00:36:01,230 --> 00:36:02,480
It hurts.

435
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:29,710
You're always upset whenever you see me.

436
00:36:31,120 --> 00:36:32,280
What are you upset about?

437
00:36:33,510 --> 00:36:34,670
Are you upset

438
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:36,030
that I admire Xihe,

439
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:38,110
or that Xihe

440
00:36:38,110 --> 00:36:39,190
has feelings for me?

441
00:36:43,840 --> 00:36:45,150
If I die here,

442
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:48,000
you won't escape the blame either.

443
00:37:16,030 --> 00:37:16,670
Changqing.

444
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:20,190
Take my advice.

445
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:25,110
Give up those resentful thoughts.

446
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:34,150
Haven't you always been
the one who plans ahead

447
00:37:34,150 --> 00:37:35,110
and wins from afar?

448
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:37,440
What?

449
00:37:38,112 --> 00:37:40,510
Are you really afraid
someone admires Crown Princess?

450
00:37:45,360 --> 00:37:46,480
I'm annoyed.

451
00:37:49,320 --> 00:37:51,110
Who could tolerate

452
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:52,880
someone coveting their wife?

453
00:37:54,710 --> 00:37:56,360
If you're really that narrow-minded,

454
00:37:56,670 --> 00:37:58,510
you'll never find peace in this life.

455
00:37:59,030 --> 00:38:00,710
A lady like Xihe

456
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:02,880
will naturally
attract countless admirers.

457
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:04,320
Besides,

458
00:38:05,230 --> 00:38:06,630
you don't have...

459
00:38:08,230 --> 00:38:09,400
I knew it.

460
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:12,030
Some people spend every day
hoping something happens to me

461
00:38:12,840 --> 00:38:14,110
so they can take advantage of it.

462
00:38:37,550 --> 00:38:40,070
What a beautiful full moon.

463
00:38:46,150 --> 00:38:47,320
What moon?

464
00:38:47,320 --> 00:38:48,670
Exactly. What moon?

465
00:38:48,720 --> 00:38:50,736
Something that doesn't exist
simply doesn't exist.

466
00:38:50,800 --> 00:38:52,880
No matter how much you chase it,
or long for it,

467
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:54,960
isn't that just wishful thinking

468
00:38:55,110 --> 00:38:56,280
and self-deception?

469
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:01,360
Do you believe

470
00:39:01,952 --> 00:39:03,760
I'll kill you with a knife right now?

471
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:05,400
I do, Changqing.

472
00:39:06,280 --> 00:39:07,280
But right now,

473
00:39:07,392 --> 00:39:08,440
you don't have a knife.

474
00:39:29,670 --> 00:39:30,920
Enough.

475
00:39:32,280 --> 00:39:33,710
Stop saying things that annoy me.

476
00:39:33,800 --> 00:39:34,670
Get some rest.

477
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:28,630
I'm hungry.

478
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:30,070
Don't you have hands and feet?

479
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:40,400
Don't you think

480
00:40:40,448 --> 00:40:42,480
that your chain is longer
and mine is shorter,

481
00:40:42,640 --> 00:40:44,480
so it'd be easier for you
to take care of me?

482
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:51,150
That's right.

483
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:54,400
I'll outlive you.

484
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:08,000
Come on.

485
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:38,510
Huayong.

486
00:41:39,550 --> 00:41:40,110
Huayong.

487
00:41:40,590 --> 00:41:41,280
What's wrong?

488
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:43,710
Are you alright?

489
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,070
Huayong.

490
00:41:49,590 --> 00:41:50,400
Are you alright?

491
00:41:58,880 --> 00:42:00,000
After all these years,

492
00:42:01,376 --> 00:42:04,030
this is the first time
I've felt brotherly affection from you.

493
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:07,360
It feels so warm.

494
00:42:16,992 --> 00:42:18,880
The hatred between us
over the lady we love

495
00:42:19,190 --> 00:42:20,190
can never be reconciled.

496
00:42:21,150 --> 00:42:22,400
What brotherly affection?

497
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:27,190
Why don't you understand?

498
00:42:29,000 --> 00:42:30,920
No one can decide Xihe's future.

499
00:42:31,568 --> 00:42:33,344
Even if she is
that person from the past,

500
00:42:34,440 --> 00:42:36,590
all she wants now is to be Shen Xihe.

501
00:42:37,230 --> 00:42:38,590
That is her choice.

502
00:42:45,760 --> 00:42:46,590
I believe

503
00:42:48,670 --> 00:42:50,070
no one but me

504
00:42:52,360 --> 00:42:54,360
would dare marry
the former Crown Princess.

505
00:42:57,360 --> 00:42:58,360
In the end,

506
00:42:59,280 --> 00:43:00,840
she'll come back to me.

507
00:43:07,150 --> 00:43:09,710
Xihe is a phoenix
soaring across the heavens.

508
00:43:10,280 --> 00:43:11,440
She is free.

509
00:43:11,440 --> 00:43:13,330
She was meant
to look down upon the world,

510
00:43:13,344 --> 00:43:14,480
not to belong to anyone.

511
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:17,480
If you still can't understand that,

512
00:43:17,960 --> 00:43:19,320
then the bond between you two

513
00:43:19,960 --> 00:43:20,960
ended long ago.

514
00:43:41,920 --> 00:43:43,360
Haven't you always wanted to know

515
00:43:43,510 --> 00:43:45,150
who poisoned you?

516
00:43:45,150 --> 00:43:47,344
I can tell you the truth right now.

517
00:43:47,350 --> 00:43:49,568
If I can't find the Crown Prince,
I'm not going back.

518
00:43:50,180 --> 00:43:51,900
♪A wall that falls with a single push♪

519
00:43:51,920 --> 00:43:52,550
Your Highness.

520
00:43:52,840 --> 00:43:53,710
Your Highness!

521
00:43:53,710 --> 00:43:56,010
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

522
00:43:56,030 --> 00:43:57,110
Are you still tired?

523
00:43:57,280 --> 00:43:58,150
With you here,

524
00:43:58,360 --> 00:43:59,280
everything is alright.

525
00:44:04,430 --> 00:44:07,370
♪I've hidden so many words♪

526
00:44:07,990 --> 00:44:10,790
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

527
00:44:11,660 --> 00:44:18,630
♪So never uncover♪

528
00:44:18,820 --> 00:44:21,180
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

529
00:44:22,310 --> 00:44:25,040
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

530
00:44:26,000 --> 00:44:31,340
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

531
00:44:33,100 --> 00:44:35,920
♪Every answer I gave♪

532
00:44:36,720 --> 00:44:39,570
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

533
00:44:40,360 --> 00:44:43,730
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

534
00:44:43,990 --> 00:44:47,300
♪How hard it truly was?♪

535
00:44:50,270 --> 00:44:53,710
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

536
00:44:54,700 --> 00:44:57,030
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

537
00:44:58,300 --> 00:45:04,060
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

538
00:45:05,470 --> 00:45:08,600
♪It's a shame I never could♪

539
00:45:09,050 --> 00:45:12,060
♪Give you a moon in return♪

540
00:45:12,170 --> 00:45:18,810
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

541
00:45:18,810 --> 00:45:22,480
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

542
00:45:23,350 --> 00:45:26,110
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

543
00:45:26,550 --> 00:45:29,680
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

544
00:45:30,120 --> 00:45:36,070
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

545
00:45:37,470 --> 00:45:41,020
♪You'll never♪

546
00:45:41,300 --> 00:45:50,770
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

547
00:46:16,940 --> 00:46:20,420
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)

